        "Identify the terms from $(3 - x + 2x^3)$ that combine with $(64 - 96x + 60x^2 - 20x^3)$ to form $x^3$.",
        "Evaluate $3(-20) + (-1)(60) + 2(64)$."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Identify the pairs producing an $x^3$ term in the product $(3 - x + 2x^3)(64 - 96x + 60x^2 - 20x^3)$:\n$$\\text{Term in } x^3 = 3(-20x^3) + (-x)(60x^2) + (2x^3)(64)$$",
        "Calculate the combined coefficient:\n$$\\text{Coefficient of } x^3 = 3(-20) - 1(60) + 2(64) = -60 - 60 + 128 = 8$$"
      ],
